fix:
Invert conditions to handle and return error states immediately, placing success logic at the top level:
```rust
fn load_config() -> Result<Config> {
    let file = File::open("config.json").map_err(|_| Error::Open)?;
    let data = read_data(file).map_err(|_| Error::Read)?;
    parse(data).map_err(|_| Error::Parse)
}
```
